Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 10:58:19 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 54/72] deepseek: gate Engram shard preflight behind a flag

Validate packed Engram tables against the hasher and each rank's owned range before CUDA and TP initialization. Leave validation disabled by default and retain the existing serving read path.
---
