 .../deepseek_v41/engram_validate_test.zig     | 114 ++++++++++++++++++
 zig/src/families/deepseek_v41/shared_test.zig |   1 +
 4 files changed, 158 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 zig/src/families/deepseek_v41/engram_validate.zig
 create mode 100644 zig/src/families/deepseek_v41/engram_validate_test.zig

